{
  "id": "b2-e39-extreme-weather",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Extreme weather",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what is the weather like where you live at this time of year?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, does the weather change the way you feel?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you like to do in different seasons?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever experienced extreme weather?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e39-a1",
            "b2-e39-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people dealing with difficult weather. Compare the photographs, and say what problems the people might have.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations would be harder to deal with? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e39-b1",
            "b2-e39-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people in different weather. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you enjoy extreme weather? Why or why not?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can help communities cope with extreme weather, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e39-extreme-weather",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help communities cope with extreme weather?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e39-extreme-weather",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most important?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about weather and climate.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that the weather is becoming more extreme. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should governments spend more on preparing for natural disasters?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how can individuals prepare for bad weather?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it right to build houses in places that often flood?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, why do some people choose to live in dangerous places?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e39-extreme-weather/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
